OL,3,GNEWSATwo teachers struck off for
OL,4,Aencouraging pupils to fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teachers have been struck off after
OL,7,Fencouraging two pupils to fight at
OL,8,Fschool while "smiling and laughing".
OL,10,FAdrian Ferguson, 56, and Richard Lewis,
OL,11,F47, watched the two pupils "throw
OL,12,Fpunches and grappling with each other"
OL,13,Ffor 20 seconds at Peak Academy, in
OL,14,FDursley, Gloucestershire, before
OL,15,Fattempting to stop them in October
OL,16,F2019, according to a Teaching
OL,17,FRegulation Agency misconduct panel
OL,18,Freport.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
