OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSATwo teachers struck off for
OL,4,Aencouraging pupils to fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report said one of the pupils,
OL,7,Freferred to as Pupil A, claimed to
OL,8,Fpolice in an interview that Ferguson
OL,9,Fhad tried to "fist bump him after the
OL,10,Ffight to say well done".
OL,12,FThe panel banned the teachers from the
OL,13,Fprofession earlier this month for
OL,14,Fencouraging the fight and failing to
OL,15,Fsafeguard the pair.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
